<li data-start="614" data-end="783"><strong data-start="616" data-end="641">Premium Craftsmanship</strong> &#8211; Constructed with high-quality acrylic and durable materials to withstand continuous operation while maintaining crystal-clear visibility.</li>
<li data-start="784" data-end="956"><strong data-start="786" data-end="811">Customizable Lighting</strong> &#8211; Integrated LED lighting highlights the swirling bubbles, offering adjustable colors and brightness to match the mood and style of the space.</li>
<li data-start="957" data-end="1091"><strong data-start="959" data-end="985">Low Maintenance Design</strong> &#8211; The enclosed system ensures minimal upkeep while delivering consistent performance and visual appeal.</li>
</ul>
