</ul>
<h4 data-start="1452" data-end="1488"><strong data-start="1457" data-end="1486">3. Lighting Enhancements:</strong></h4>
<ul data-start="1489" data-end="1595">
<li data-start="1489" data-end="1595">Incorporate LED lighting with static or dynamic color-changing options to create the perfect ambiance.</li>
